  "details": "I have some drinks in my bar environment. These drinks have a drinking state machine associated with them in Mecanim, where the user will run through a series of animations.\n\nThere is a strange bug on the animations. I am using an AnimationBool event to set a trigger in the state machine to trigger the next animation. This works fine, but if this is done on an animation that is set up to not loop at the end, it will endlessly loop the animation.\n\nI can show you more information if the problem is not clear from this post, please contact me at rhyok@teamrarebloom.com.",
